OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud with
OL,6,Fsome bright spells and scattered
OL,7,Fshowers. Showers will be occasionally
OL,8,Fheavy. Feeling rather cool in the
OL,9,Ffresh occasionally strong west or
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers dying out this
OL,13,Fevening. Then the rest of the night
OL,14,Fwill be dry with some lengthy clear
OL,15,Fperiods. A cold night in some
OL,16,Fsheltered glens.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FAll parts will have a dry
OL,19,Fday with variable amounts of cloud and
OL,20,Fsome sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
